     "value": "Homodimer (PubMed:35750769). Interacts with CNNM4/ACDP4 (PubMed:15840172). Interacts with RANBP2 (PubMed:34400285). Interacts with COX19; to support COX11 dimerization and copper coordination (PubMed:35750769). Interacts with COX2; during cytochrome c oxidase assembly (PubMed:35750769)"
